        <mxCell id="c245" value="&lt;i&gt;Report view, page Materials Build, filtered to the 3 years of the window (the build matrix to 2026). Columns and line share one axis here, because their ranges overlap. The build matrix is sorted by the build, groups and items alike, and scrolls: its first 9 of 24 rows are drawn, with the other raw materials, the Packaging group and the total below. Outlined in teal: the six items at the top. Matrix rows sort by name; total rows of the tables, the requester table and the page&#x27;s text box are not drawn.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="738" width="860" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
